abstract: "Analysis code, public source data, and deposited results for a graduation project reanalysing GSE287540 and GSE274664. The project examines transcriptomic associations with checkpoint inhibitor-induced liver injury and miRNA-associated features in treatment-response groups from separate cohorts."
